---
id: NFR-example
title: The example stays correct under repeated input
category: idempotency
threshold: Processing the same input twice yields the same result as once.
evidence:
  - tests/test_example.py::test_the_example_is_idempotent
---
A nonfunctional requirement belongs to the feature that needs it, with a threshold
someone could fail. `evidence` resolves like an acceptance criterion's `tests`: rename
the test and the build fails with PAC-902. A shipped feature whose requirement has no
evidence fails with PAC-904.
